nt filename for advice; unknown Jim0.79 metadata cannot borrow it. Namespace names retain their own literal naming purpose, separate from scalar/closed-element variable geometry. Authoring/render/load parity preserves the same selected descriptor without granting runtime info script, successful filesystem access, current stored path values, entered namespace/body or Native link authority. SourceTarget and auto_path consumers capture genuine original whole words under the same complete analysis/input/config, source image and immutable Realm/inventory owner. The selected source-navigation schema and operand membership remain independent of reporting path or form. A child declaration retains its separate original source-load lineage. OriginalSourceAutoPathExpression applies the selected mutation after the whole argument value is complete: Assign splits it using the retained list grammar; Append keeps one whole element. Bare auto_path requires the retained root source namespace outside definition bodies, while unresolved local/global alias receivers decline. WorkspaceSource retains the sealed expression plan and SourceResolver folds it against the same inventory; installed source edges, namespace seeds, constant imports, run order and package ancestry consume this plan. Explicit literal-only compatibility APIs remain separate. These source/API controls establish no runtime filename/cwd, current stored path value, file/package execution, installed native receiver or entered namespace/body.",
